This is a known bug in OSF/1 v1.3 !!

I got a patch from DEC:

Installation patch cam_tape

For Native OSF/1 1.3:

save the original /sys/BINARY/cam_tape.o 
Install module cam_tape.o in /sys/BINARY/cam_tape.o

For Realtime OSF/1 1.3:

save the original /sys/BINARY/cam_tape.o 
Install module rt_cam_tape.o in /sys/BINARY/cam_tape.o

After installing the kernel patch, rebuild the kernel
with doconfig -c <MYNAME>
and install this as /vmunix after saving the old /vmunix

And after this backups went from 8 hours to 1.5 hour duration.

OSF/1 2.0 seems to work OK, but we are suspicious :-)

