It's a bug in cam_tape.o, the SCSI tape driver.  If any non-write
operation is done at BOT, it turns off the "buffered I/O" bit in the
tape controller, resulting in non-streaming writes (VERY slow!).

Get a patched cam_tape.o from your Digital support channels.
