You need to modify the file ./web2c-5.851d/lib/config.h

I believe it says something like:

#ifndef INTEGER_TYPE
#define INTEGER_TYPE long
#endif

You want to change this to read:
#ifndef INTEGER_TYPE
#if defined( __alpha)
#define INTEGER_TYPE int
#else
#define INTEGER_TYPE long
#endif
#endif


Good luck,

