Look in the file /usr/lib/X11/xdm/Xresources. However, if you are using
OSF/1 1.2 or 1.3 then the only line that has any effect if you change it
is 

dxlogin.LogoY:          100

which gives the distance of the Digital logo from the top of the screen.

OSF/1 2.0 probably does take notice of other changes, but I don't know for
sure.

