What is your console mode variable "boot_osflags" set to?  If it's
"s", then you'll boot to single user mode unless you override the flag
with the "boot -fl ..." command.

Set boot_osflags = a if you want to go to run-level 3 upon rebooting.
Set boot_osflags = i if you want the bootstrap program to prompt you for
the kernel filename to boot.


