[rest deleted]


I can only speak from ULTRIX experience, but as far as I know, DEC boxes
need to have the /etc/svc.conf file in the ~ftp/etc directory because
they must know to look up user info *first* in /etc/passwd and
/etc/group and *then* (possibly) in a passwd server. Otherwise DEC boxes
get totally lost and can't display user/group names.



